  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes a hybrid QLSTM model where a classical LSTM feeds a 4‑qubit variational quantum circuit (ZZFeatureMap + RealAmplitudes). On AAPL stock data (1,508 observations), the QLSTM achieves R² ≈ 0.83, MSE ≈ 85.16, MAE ≈ 7.49, and RMSE ≈ 9.23, outperforming a classical LSTM baseline (R² ≈ 0.54, MSE ≈ 235.74) in prediction accuracy.",
